  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/7ecd6eb65d74cf1bcf.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"ציור של עיפרון מונח על תשבץ - סמל לאתגר מחשבה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"268\" data-original-width=\"294\" src=\"/assets/images/content/7ecd6eb65d74cf1bcf.png\" /></a></div><p></p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מְאַתְּרִים אֶת הָאֲתָרִים</span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">גלו את המקומות (המוזכרים בפרשה) - עפ\"י משפטי החידה.</span></span></p><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">לדוגמה:</span></span></p><p style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><u>משפט החידה:</u>&nbsp;<br /></span>הַיָּם שֶׁנִּגְזַר וְהָפַךְ לְמַעֲבָר</span></p></span><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span face=\"Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><u>פתרון:<br /></u></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">סוּף</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">משפטי החידה</span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"></p><ol style=\"background-color: white;\"><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">כָּאן בָּנָה יַעֲקֹב לְמִקְנֵהוּ מַחֲסוֹת - וּבְנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל אָפוּ מַצּוֹת</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">אַלּוּפֵי אֶרֶץ זוֹ נִבְהֲלוּ - כַּאֲשֶׁר אֶת נִסֵּי יִשְׂרָאֵל שָׁמְעוּ</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">כָּאן&nbsp;נִמְצְאוּ לַרְעֵבִים - עֵינוֹת מַיִם וּתְמָרִים</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">לְכָּאן&nbsp;בָּא עֲמָלֵק לַמִּלְחָמָה - וּלְצַהַ\"ל הָיָה (בֶּעָבָר) בְּסִיס טִיסָה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מוֹעֵצָה מְקוֹמִית בִּמְחוֹז דָּרוֹם - מִדַּת מָן לְאָדָם לְיוֹם</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">אֶחָד מֵהַמִּדְבָּרִיּוֹת בְּשֶׁטַח סִינַי - אֵלָיו בָּרְחָה הָגָר מִשָּׂרַי</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">אֶרֶץ זוֹ שׁוֹכֶנֶת בַּדֶּרֶךְ הֲכִי קְצָרָה - אֲבָל הָעָם עָלוּל לַחֲשֹׁשׁ מִמִּלְחָמָה</span></li></ol></span></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #212121; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 לא מת<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 צמח נמוך<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מתפללים לבואו<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מצוידים בנשק (מהפרשה) - כתיב חסר\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 ממהר\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 היחידה לחקירות שוטרים (ראשי תיבות)\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מרגיש</span></span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מאתרים את האתרים</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">סֻכּוֹת</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">אֱדוֹם</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">אֵילִם</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">רְפִידִים</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">עֹמֶר</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">שׁוּר</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">פְּלִשְׁתִּים</span></li></ol><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: large; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"animation-delay: -0.01ms; animation-duration: 0.01ms; animation-iteration-count: 1; background-color: white; color: #202122; font-family: &quot;Taamey Frank CLM&quot;, &quot;SBL Hebrew&quot;, &quot;Ezra SIL SR&quot;, &quot;Ezra SIL&quot;, &quot;Arial Unicode MS&quot;; font-size: 21px; scroll-behavior: auto; text-wrap: nowrap; transition-duration: 0ms;\"><span style=\"animation-delay: -0.01ms; animation-duration: 0.01ms; animation-iteration-count: 1; clear: right; float: right; height: 0.5em; margin-right: -1em; scroll-behavior: auto; transition-duration: 0ms; width: 0px;\"><span style=\"animation-delay: -0.01ms; animation-duration: 0.01ms; animation-iteration-count: 1; font-size: 0.6em; scroll-behavior: auto; transition-duration: 0ms;\"><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%93%D7%91%D7%